cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "tavan: Lightweight time-series scenario generation and forecasting"
abstract: >-
  tavan is a dependency-light Python library for probabilistic time-series
  scenario generation and forecasting in power systems, energy and finance.
  Its only hard dependency is NumPy; all deep-learning models run on a
  built-in CPU automatic-differentiation engine.
authors:
  - family-names: Peivand
    given-names: Ali
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alipeivand1376/tavan"
keywords:
  - time series
  - scenario generation
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - power systems
  - generative models
  - conformal prediction
  - false data injection
  - moving target defense
